<title>AUSTRIA: OMV expects good earnings in 1997.</title>
<headline>OMV expects good earnings in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian oil and chemicals group OMV said on Tuesday it expected a good set of earnings in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;From today's point of view we can expect with confidence a good earnings development in 1997,&quot; OMV said in a statement released ahead of a news conference.</p>
</text>
